@startuml
note across
Scenario 2 – Contextual Route Evaluation
"This sequence diagram illustrates the internal contextual evaluation of route
candidates performed by SafeNav. This scenario is automatically triggered by
the API Layer after route candidates are generated and may be skipped depending
on system configuration or availability of contextual data."
end note

participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Routing Engine" as RE
participant "Context Analyzer" as CA
participant "Data Management" as DM
participant "Meteo Data Source" as Meteo
participant "Open Data Source" as OpenData

API -> RE : request route evaluation\n(RouteCandidates)

RE -> CA : evaluate routes\n(RouteCandidates)

CA -> DM : request weather data
DM -> Meteo : fetch weather conditions
Meteo --> DM : WeatherData
DM --> CA : WeatherData

CA -> DM : request urban context data
DM -> OpenData : fetch urban data
OpenData --> DM : UrbanData
DM --> CA : UrbanData

CA --> RE : RouteScores

RE --> API : RouteScores

API --> API : enrich RouteResponse\n(with contextual scores)
@enduml
